# Generated by scripts/build-fumola-wasm.sh. The .js and .wasm are committed
# on purpose: branch previews deploy _build/default/src/web/www verbatim, so
# an uncommitted runtime would mean a preview where the Fumola livelit cannot
# run. The TypeScript declarations are of no use to Hazel.
src/web/www/fumola/*.d.ts
